	(property "Note" "Stocked40MHz fundamental,CL10pF,35ohmESR,10ppm initial/15ppm stability -40..85C,100uW maximumdrive,0.8mmmaxheight. Exact manufacturer ABM8 July29,2020 spec C0<=3pF. Larger3.2x2.5 host must rebuild actual near-S3 routing; primary recommended1.3x1.05 lands,1.0/0.7 gaps. Existing15p/15pC0G yields7.5pF series plus assumed2.5pF totalstray=10pF nominal, not measured CL. Loadbank/clock amplitude/drive/cold-start margin must be measured at first bring-up; do not claim actual negative resistance or frequency without measurement. Pins2/4 casegrounds,1/3 crystal terminals; no topology change."
